WEBVTT

00:31.630 --> 00:35.180
♪ Pink hands so fine ♪

00:35.200 --> 00:38.580
♪ Gold-branded wine ♪

00:38.850 --> 00:44.820
♪ Spring paints willows green;
palace walls can't confine ♪

00:45.980 --> 00:49.610
♪ East wind unfair ♪

00:49.630 --> 00:53.140
♪ Happy times rare ♪

00:53.160 --> 00:56.650
♪ In my heart, sad thoughts throng ♪

00:56.670 --> 01:00.180
♪ We've severed for years long ♪

01:00.200 --> 01:06.260
♪ Wrong, wrong, wrong ♪

01:19.520 --> 01:23.800
Si Jin

01:23.820 --> 01:27.800
Episode 20

01:27.800 --> 01:30.320
(Haitang Chamber)

01:30.970 --> 01:32.640
Yi, you suddenly moved back.

01:32.660 --> 01:34.340
Are you adjusting well?

01:36.880 --> 01:38.300
Everything at home

01:38.320 --> 01:39.320
feels so familiar,

01:39.320 --> 01:40.920
like I never left.

01:41.520 --> 01:43.080
Yet, looking back,

01:43.280 --> 01:45.360
I've been married away for so many years.

01:45.720 --> 01:47.080
Yi,

01:47.360 --> 01:49.040
now that you're home,

01:49.400 --> 01:50.270
don't dwell

01:50.270 --> 01:51.760
on that ill-fated bond anymore.

01:54.000 --> 01:55.300
I just can't figure out

01:55.320 --> 01:57.200
why I was wrong about him.

01:58.200 --> 01:59.320
From the day we met,

01:59.320 --> 02:01.400
he played the perfect gentleman.

02:01.600 --> 02:03.500
After spending so many years with him,

02:03.520 --> 02:04.780
I only saw his true colors

02:04.800 --> 02:06.640
at the end.

02:09.440 --> 02:11.060
This isn't your fault.

02:11.080 --> 02:12.820
He fooled us all.

02:12.840 --> 02:14.440
We're all responsible.

02:14.640 --> 02:15.720
If anyone of us

02:15.720 --> 02:16.640
had seen

02:16.640 --> 02:18.480
the slightest hint,

02:18.840 --> 02:20.380
you'd have been

02:20.400 --> 02:22.160
spared this nightmare.

02:22.960 --> 02:25.600
But I don't regret it.

02:26.400 --> 02:27.960
You don't?

02:29.160 --> 02:30.300
Why?

02:30.320 --> 02:32.640
Because we were deeply in love.

02:34.040 --> 02:35.180
Back then,

02:35.200 --> 02:37.300
he was the man who held my heart,

02:37.320 --> 02:39.000
luminous as the moon.

02:41.080 --> 02:42.920
Even in today's situation,

02:42.920 --> 02:44.780
I've come to my senses,

02:44.800 --> 02:47.460
and I detest, resent, and loathe him,

02:47.480 --> 02:48.840
still,

02:48.920 --> 02:50.980
I have the best memories,

02:51.000 --> 02:52.360
right?

02:52.600 --> 02:54.380
But it didn't

02:54.400 --> 02:56.000
end well.

02:57.280 --> 02:58.540
Some things are not

02:58.560 --> 03:00.640
just about endings.

03:02.200 --> 03:03.560
If...

03:04.560 --> 03:06.600
If it's destined to go nowhere,

03:07.520 --> 03:09.360
is it still worth trying?

03:11.640 --> 03:13.580
When you spoke,

03:13.600 --> 03:15.300
were you

03:15.320 --> 03:17.000
thinking of Mr. Yu?

03:19.600 --> 03:21.020
You see through me again.

03:21.040 --> 03:22.460
Affection leaks through;

03:22.480 --> 03:24.400
concern can't be faked.

03:25.300 --> 03:27.810
At Lingshui, I saw

03:27.830 --> 03:29.360
your growing affection for him.

03:29.880 --> 03:31.600
And his feelings for you

03:32.560 --> 03:34.000
probably run deeper.

03:34.340 --> 03:35.760
Really?

03:35.860 --> 03:37.580
Do you really think

03:37.600 --> 03:40.050
he cares about me?

03:40.070 --> 03:41.910
The mountain is hidden from view;

03:41.930 --> 03:44.440
you're cradled in its folds.

04:12.880 --> 04:15.680
(Fight)

04:16.840 --> 04:18.840
Greetings, sir.

04:30.200 --> 04:33.380
I'm Bulwark-general Cui Xu

04:33.400 --> 04:35.580
and Commander of the Guards.

04:35.600 --> 04:37.640
From now on, you will

04:37.640 --> 04:39.800
be a Guard as well.

04:40.000 --> 04:41.900
You shall be devoted

04:41.920 --> 04:43.720
and give it your all

04:43.800 --> 04:45.100
to keep His Majesty,

04:45.120 --> 04:46.060
our city,

04:46.080 --> 04:48.080
and our state safe!

04:48.200 --> 04:49.380
Yes!

04:49.400 --> 04:53.960
(Border of Ling'an)

04:59.640 --> 05:00.920
(Earl Dongping's Mansion, Jiang)

05:00.920 --> 05:02.280
Good.

05:02.440 --> 05:04.120
Good to have you back.

05:04.840 --> 05:06.360
Good.

05:07.120 --> 05:09.080
l missed you so much.

05:11.040 --> 05:14.620
Well then, you two catch up.

05:14.640 --> 05:16.220
I'll prepare the feast.

05:16.240 --> 05:17.640
Tonight we'll have

05:17.640 --> 05:20.000
a proper reunion at home.

05:20.120 --> 05:21.480
Thank you, Father.

05:24.040 --> 05:25.240
Pei, you've traveled a long way.

05:25.240 --> 05:26.280
Have some tea.

05:26.280 --> 05:27.680
Thanks, Qiao.

05:33.640 --> 05:34.600
I missed

05:34.600 --> 05:36.260
our tea so much.

05:36.280 --> 05:38.920
Do they skimp on your tea allowance?

05:39.280 --> 05:40.860
Not at all, Mother.

05:40.880 --> 05:42.440
The tea we drink at home

05:42.460 --> 05:43.660
is not cost-effective

05:43.680 --> 05:45.140
for the Lin Family.

05:45.160 --> 05:46.740
My mother-in-law is teaching me in ledgers.

05:46.760 --> 05:49.360
I should set an example.

05:49.920 --> 05:51.160
The tea I pick

05:51.160 --> 05:52.700
isn't pricey,

05:52.720 --> 05:54.280
but it's refined.

05:54.520 --> 05:55.360
Next time,

05:55.360 --> 05:57.360
I'll bring you some for tasting.

05:57.800 --> 05:59.360
Since Pei married off,

05:59.360 --> 06:00.880
she's grown wiser and matured.

06:00.880 --> 06:02.000
Who would deny?

06:02.000 --> 06:03.320
Every inch a lady now.

06:03.320 --> 06:04.640
My mother-in-law is skilled in needlework.

06:04.640 --> 06:05.880
I've learned a lot from her

06:05.880 --> 06:07.220
and made some embroidered trinkets.

06:07.240 --> 06:09.520
I'll present some pieces to the elders.

06:10.520 --> 06:11.460
These days,

06:11.480 --> 06:12.880
you'd better steer clear

06:12.880 --> 06:14.340
of your lineal mother.

06:14.360 --> 06:16.100
With Zhan now a Imperial Insignia Guard,

06:16.120 --> 06:17.640
they are in a foul mood.

06:17.640 --> 06:19.700
Then we must visit them more

06:19.720 --> 06:21.940
to lift our name.

06:21.960 --> 06:24.940
Although I didn't marry into a noble family,

06:24.960 --> 06:27.620
my husband has a successful official career

06:27.640 --> 06:28.660
and treats me well.

06:28.680 --> 06:31.300
If not for his duties today,

06:31.320 --> 06:32.160
he would have

06:32.160 --> 06:34.080
come with me.

06:36.440 --> 06:37.700
Miss,

06:37.720 --> 06:40.960
your business is booming!

06:43.360 --> 06:44.280
None of your business.

06:44.280 --> 06:46.480
The street has always been rough.

06:46.520 --> 06:48.400
Thanks to us upholding justice,

06:48.400 --> 06:50.300
you're able to run your business in peace.

06:50.320 --> 06:53.240
Shouldn't our chivalry

06:53.560 --> 06:55.720
earn some gratitude?

06:55.720 --> 06:56.580
Exactly.

06:56.600 --> 06:57.580
Well,

06:57.600 --> 06:58.440
he...

06:58.450 --> 06:59.820
No worries.

07:01.320 --> 07:03.160
Aren't you the very reason

07:03.440 --> 07:04.400
there's no peace here?

07:04.400 --> 07:05.760
You!

07:06.560 --> 07:07.480
30 coppers a month,

07:07.480 --> 07:09.100
do you pay or not?

07:09.120 --> 07:11.200
Ok, I'll pay.

07:12.280 --> 07:14.080
Bro!

07:14.200 --> 07:15.600
How dare you!

07:16.040 --> 07:18.320
Wench, I'll kill you!

07:21.480 --> 07:23.440
Imperial Insignia Guard here. Who dares defy?

07:23.440 --> 07:24.280
Imperial Insignia Guard?

07:24.290 --> 07:26.040
It's a Guard.

07:26.520 --> 07:27.360
You...

07:27.380 --> 07:29.140
Why don't you serve the Imperial City

07:29.160 --> 07:30.520
instead of meddling here?

07:30.520 --> 07:33.300
You bully the weak and extort money.

07:33.320 --> 07:34.240
Shouldn't I meddle?

07:34.240 --> 07:36.240
Your evil actions endanger public safety.

07:36.240 --> 07:37.420
Shouldn't I meddle?

07:37.440 --> 07:38.500
Or should I bring in

07:38.520 --> 07:40.540
the Capital Security?

07:40.560 --> 07:41.820
Get lost!

07:41.840 --> 07:43.480
Well done!

07:43.480 --> 07:45.300
The Guard is indeed majestic.

07:45.310 --> 07:46.470
Problem solved.

07:46.480 --> 07:48.520
Back to shopping, everyone.

07:51.190 --> 07:52.840
Well done.

08:10.400 --> 08:12.380
You're good, Jiang Zhan.

08:12.400 --> 08:13.320
Since joining the Guard,

08:13.320 --> 08:14.980
your eloquence has sharpened.

08:15.000 --> 08:17.200
Wasn't I always eloquent?

08:20.120 --> 08:21.800
It's heavy.

08:24.560 --> 08:25.920
Golden Eagle?

08:27.120 --> 08:29.400
It's a unique symbol of the Guard.

08:30.600 --> 08:31.960
You know it?

08:35.310 --> 08:36.670
Not bad.

08:36.800 --> 08:38.550
Still, it falls short

08:38.570 --> 08:39.960
of my Nie Yinniang's dagger.

08:41.800 --> 08:43.160
Jiang Zhan,

08:43.280 --> 08:44.740
freshly joining the Guard,

08:44.760 --> 08:45.780
you're not going home.

08:45.800 --> 08:47.320
Are you here to show off?

08:47.320 --> 08:48.680
I...

08:48.720 --> 08:49.620
I...

08:49.640 --> 08:51.720
I'm busy.

08:51.800 --> 08:53.560
I just happened

08:53.560 --> 08:54.800
to stop by,

08:54.800 --> 08:56.000
- Young Master!
- and saw someone...

08:56.000 --> 08:57.920
Young Master!

08:58.600 --> 09:00.300
You walked too fast!

09:00.320 --> 09:02.720
But this isn't the way home.

09:04.600 --> 09:06.160
Isn't it?

09:07.520 --> 09:08.960
Since joining the Guard,

09:08.960 --> 09:10.340
I can't even find my way home.

09:10.360 --> 09:11.800
Which way?

09:11.920 --> 09:14.320
- Your sword.
- Ji, hold it for me.

09:34.920 --> 09:37.400
Greetings, Grandma.

09:38.240 --> 09:39.260
Zhan,

09:39.280 --> 09:42.120
come closer. Let me see you.

09:45.280 --> 09:47.320
So imposing!

09:47.680 --> 09:49.200
You know,

09:49.200 --> 09:50.780
among our house's youth,

09:50.800 --> 09:53.080
you lag in studies,

09:53.080 --> 09:54.440
defy orders,

09:54.480 --> 09:55.400
chase fun,

09:55.400 --> 09:58.180
nowhere near your brother, Cang.

09:58.200 --> 10:01.100
Mother, are you praising him?

10:01.120 --> 10:02.840
Who would have thought

10:02.840 --> 10:05.560
you would become

10:05.560 --> 10:06.920
our pride?

10:08.160 --> 10:09.900
Grandma, you know what,

10:09.920 --> 10:10.960
today when we reported for duty,

10:10.960 --> 10:12.540
among all the guards,

10:12.560 --> 10:14.380
our commander, General Cui,

10:14.400 --> 10:16.500
chose me alone to serve

10:16.520 --> 10:19.060
at His Majesty's Mid-Autumn hunt.

10:19.080 --> 10:20.570
Which General Cui?

10:20.590 --> 10:21.430
Cui Xu?

10:21.440 --> 10:23.600
Yes. You know him?

10:27.040 --> 10:30.120
You've finally made something of yourself.

10:30.160 --> 10:31.140
Come,

10:31.160 --> 10:33.840
let's have a good drink to celebrate.

10:34.360 --> 10:35.460
Ancheng,

10:35.480 --> 10:38.340
Zhan has just joined the Guard

10:38.360 --> 10:39.620
and you've already

10:39.640 --> 10:41.080
been impatient

10:41.080 --> 10:42.620
about Mother's instructions?

10:42.640 --> 10:45.120
It's ok. Let them go.

10:45.720 --> 10:47.020
Zhan,

10:47.040 --> 10:49.160
Grandma would remind you,

10:49.160 --> 10:50.640
now that you've joined the Guard,

10:50.640 --> 10:52.520
serve with utmost diligence.

10:52.520 --> 10:54.520
You were appointed by His Majesty.

10:54.520 --> 10:55.760
You must excel

10:55.760 --> 10:57.140
beyond others

10:57.160 --> 11:00.260
to honor His Majesty's favor.

11:00.280 --> 11:02.120
Yes, Grandma!

11:03.040 --> 11:05.640
Mother, we have to go now.

11:05.960 --> 11:07.320
Come.

11:12.120 --> 11:13.980
Go back and get Yi and Si.

11:14.000 --> 11:16.040
Let's have a big

11:16.040 --> 11:18.160
happy family celebration.

11:18.160 --> 11:19.120
Yes.

11:19.120 --> 11:20.880
I want to invite Mr. Yu too.

11:21.520 --> 11:23.560
Look how smug they are!

11:25.320 --> 11:27.600
My words earlier

11:27.600 --> 11:30.280
weren't just for Zhan,

11:30.360 --> 11:33.600
but to prod your branch.

11:34.240 --> 11:36.760
The First Branch once failed us,

11:36.760 --> 11:37.840
but now

11:37.840 --> 11:39.700
they're improving.

11:39.720 --> 11:41.380
Your must

11:41.400 --> 11:43.140
redouble your efforts

11:43.160 --> 11:44.320
so that our entire family

11:44.320 --> 11:46.700
can thrive.

11:46.720 --> 11:48.640
Yes, Mother.

11:49.040 --> 11:50.380
You're right, Mother.

11:50.400 --> 11:52.400
Well then, you can leave now.

11:57.520 --> 11:58.880
Master.

11:58.960 --> 12:00.820
Don't lose heart.

12:00.840 --> 12:02.980
What is Jiang Zhan?

12:03.000 --> 12:04.040
At most

12:04.040 --> 12:05.780
a lowly guard,

12:05.800 --> 12:08.100
not like our Cang

12:08.120 --> 12:09.480
who studies

12:09.480 --> 12:11.100
hard and earnestly.

12:11.120 --> 12:12.120
Though he is

12:12.120 --> 12:13.600
a minor magistrate now,

12:13.600 --> 12:14.480
his transfer to Ling'an

12:14.480 --> 12:15.640
in a couple of years

12:15.640 --> 12:17.340
will promise greatness.

12:17.360 --> 12:18.680
As for that petty guard...

12:18.680 --> 12:20.080
Enough!

12:25.840 --> 12:27.720
Regardless of what Jiang Zhan is,

12:27.960 --> 12:29.800
he remains Jiang blood.

12:30.440 --> 12:31.600
You're being petty

12:31.600 --> 12:33.000
and stirring up rivalry.

12:34.240 --> 12:35.160
Do you want to

12:35.160 --> 12:36.760
humiliate our branch even more?

12:42.680 --> 12:44.680
Why lash out at me?

13:09.560 --> 13:10.600
Master,

13:10.600 --> 13:12.720
have you returned from Mother's place?

13:17.640 --> 13:20.360
Now that Zhan has joined the Guard,

13:20.480 --> 13:21.940
I'm afraid

13:21.960 --> 13:24.080
Mother put pressure on our branch, right?

13:34.240 --> 13:35.880
Even if I'm bitter about it,

13:35.880 --> 13:37.360
what can I do?

13:37.880 --> 13:39.060
My elder brother

13:39.080 --> 13:40.740
is idle and irresponsible,

13:40.760 --> 13:42.110
while I'm a civilian official,

13:42.130 --> 13:43.490
what...

13:44.480 --> 13:46.160
Master,

13:46.580 --> 13:48.300
Zhan's joining the Guard

13:48.320 --> 13:49.820
is a wise choice.

13:49.840 --> 13:51.800
It suits his temperament perfectly.

13:56.120 --> 13:57.300
What's your point?

13:57.320 --> 13:59.140
I believe that while our two branches

13:59.160 --> 14:02.760
compete for dominance,

14:02.800 --> 14:03.960
in the end,

14:03.960 --> 14:05.230
glory and ruin

14:05.240 --> 14:06.960
bind us as one.

14:07.240 --> 14:09.020
If Zhan succeeds,

14:09.040 --> 14:11.560
it brings glory to our entire clan.

14:11.920 --> 14:13.220
Should Cang

14:13.240 --> 14:15.120
return to Ling'an in the future,

14:15.140 --> 14:17.160
he could get a powerful ally.

14:18.960 --> 14:20.320
That makes sense.

14:21.520 --> 14:23.120
If Zhan succeeds

14:23.440 --> 14:25.400
in the future,

14:26.240 --> 14:28.040
it will be a win for everyone.

14:33.920 --> 14:35.280
Shu,

14:36.720 --> 14:39.240
you know me better than anyone.

14:40.460 --> 14:43.840
Master, put your mind at ease.

14:45.960 --> 14:47.320
Put my mind at ease.

14:48.720 --> 14:50.440
At ease.

14:50.640 --> 14:53.160
The Transport Commissioner's son?

14:53.760 --> 14:55.160
He is kind of

14:55.160 --> 14:57.600
rough-looking.

15:00.010 --> 15:02.080
(He Zhiyuan)
Lingnan District Defender's son.

15:02.080 --> 15:04.500
It's good that he's skilled in medicine,

15:04.520 --> 15:06.100
but his appearance

15:06.120 --> 15:08.720
doesn't match Jiang Qiao.

15:09.840 --> 15:11.340
This one is good.

15:11.360 --> 15:13.780
(Xiao Lang)
Lingbei Military Commissioner's son.

15:13.800 --> 15:16.000
Prime lineage,

15:16.840 --> 15:18.280
25 years old,

15:18.280 --> 15:21.120
handsome, and imposing.

15:21.120 --> 15:24.480
He bears old...

15:25.800 --> 15:27.400
Old battlefield injuries.

15:27.720 --> 15:28.920
No wonder

15:28.920 --> 15:31.760
he's still unmarried at his age.

15:31.880 --> 15:33.040
What kind

15:33.040 --> 15:34.520
of matchmaker's list is this?

15:34.520 --> 15:36.420
Not a single suitable candidate!

15:36.440 --> 15:38.440
Then I'm going to turn them down.

15:39.440 --> 15:40.800
No rush.

15:40.960 --> 15:42.760
Military Commissioner.

15:44.160 --> 15:47.420
The Military Commissioner rules a domain

15:47.440 --> 15:49.520
and wields significant influence.

15:50.240 --> 15:52.320
As a martial official,

15:52.400 --> 15:53.880
his title sounds more prestigious

15:53.880 --> 15:56.040
than the Imperial Insignia Guard.

15:56.330 --> 15:57.370
In the past,

15:57.380 --> 16:00.120
Qian had a valiant husband,

16:00.640 --> 16:03.140
but he doesn't count anymore.

16:03.160 --> 16:04.420
And Pei

16:04.440 --> 16:06.340
married a civilian official.

16:06.360 --> 16:08.420
We need to find someone

16:08.440 --> 16:10.280
who commands military might

16:10.480 --> 16:13.440
to bolster our standing.

16:13.920 --> 16:15.340
He's physically frail,

16:15.360 --> 16:17.680
but he comes from a distinguished family.

16:19.960 --> 16:22.440
Marrying the Military Commissioner's son

16:23.160 --> 16:26.260
would be a step up for Jiang Qiao,

16:26.280 --> 16:28.560
her hard-won blessing.

16:29.920 --> 16:30.900
Oh,

16:30.920 --> 16:31.840
quickly

16:31.840 --> 16:33.440
get Jiang Qiao's portrait

16:33.440 --> 16:35.140
to the Matchmaker's Hall

16:35.160 --> 16:37.580
so the Xiao Family can evaluate her.

16:37.600 --> 16:38.960
Yes.

16:41.040 --> 16:42.620
Good, good.

16:42.640 --> 16:44.720
(Cultivate Virtue and Uphold Righteousness)

16:50.040 --> 16:52.520
Mother, where is Qiao?

16:52.720 --> 16:54.560
She went to see your lineal mother.

16:54.880 --> 16:56.640
She should be back by now.

17:04.200 --> 17:05.420
Qiao.

17:05.440 --> 17:06.300
What's wrong?

17:06.320 --> 17:07.760
What happened?

17:09.760 --> 17:10.800
Come, have a seat.

17:10.800 --> 17:12.160
Come.

17:16.760 --> 17:18.180
Did she give you a hard time?

17:18.200 --> 17:20.240
Have some hot tea. Take your time.

17:20.480 --> 17:21.840
Here.

17:23.240 --> 17:25.120
Ma'am is brokering my marriage.

17:25.160 --> 17:26.480
Isn't it a good?

17:26.480 --> 17:28.200
What family?

17:28.400 --> 17:31.200
Not to your liking?

17:31.200 --> 17:32.780
What goodwill does she harbor?

17:32.800 --> 17:34.530
Look whom she matched

17:34.540 --> 17:36.200
her own daughter with!

17:36.530 --> 17:38.550
Qian ended up going far away to Lingxi,

17:38.570 --> 17:40.260
not to mention Qiao.

17:40.280 --> 17:42.700
Mother, help me.

17:42.720 --> 17:44.160
Yes.

17:44.680 --> 17:46.120
Explain it to me

17:46.120 --> 17:47.920
in detail.

17:48.520 --> 17:50.960
Ma'am summoned me to her chambers

17:51.320 --> 17:52.240
and had someone

17:52.240 --> 17:54.200
paint my portrait.

17:55.160 --> 17:58.000
She is going to send it...

17:59.440 --> 18:00.740
No,

18:00.760 --> 18:01.600
absolutely not!

18:01.600 --> 18:03.240
Why don't I have someone check it out?

18:03.240 --> 18:04.480
No, I don't want to marry him!

18:04.480 --> 18:06.060
What's the point of checking it?

18:06.080 --> 18:07.960
Seeing Zhan join the Guard, she's trying

18:07.960 --> 18:10.120
to use Qiao's marriage to please Master.

18:10.680 --> 18:11.740
Qiao,

18:11.760 --> 18:13.660
I haven't asked you

18:13.680 --> 18:15.460
about your marriage prospects yet.

18:15.480 --> 18:17.640
What kind of man do you wish to marry?

18:20.600 --> 18:21.520
I don't want to

18:21.520 --> 18:23.080
marry a stranger.

18:24.200 --> 18:27.000
I want to marry someone I like.

18:30.840 --> 18:32.680
I hope your wish come true.

18:36.040 --> 18:37.920
What should I do?

18:37.960 --> 18:39.300
Don't worry.

18:39.320 --> 18:41.280
I'll find a solution for you.

18:48.880 --> 18:50.180
Bravo!

18:50.200 --> 18:53.900
The secret passage was no mere tunnel,

18:53.920 --> 18:56.840
but a gauntlet of death.

18:56.840 --> 18:58.480
One misstep

18:58.480 --> 19:00.400
meant certain death!

19:00.400 --> 19:02.120
Yet Li Qingyun,

19:02.120 --> 19:04.080
with unmatched courage and wit,

19:04.080 --> 19:06.160
defied every trap

19:06.160 --> 19:08.880
until he reached the end

19:08.880 --> 19:10.740
and found...

19:10.760 --> 19:13.920
What do you think he found there?

19:13.920 --> 19:15.960
Zhan, your expression

19:16.160 --> 19:17.640
is different.

19:18.800 --> 19:20.860
Joining the Guard has changed you.

19:20.880 --> 19:22.300
- Sure.
- Exactly.

19:22.320 --> 19:23.820
Everyone,

19:23.840 --> 19:25.960
let's celebrate my son

19:25.960 --> 19:28.000
becoming a guard.

19:28.120 --> 19:30.040
It's not worth mentioning.

19:30.320 --> 19:31.920
I'll toast with tea instead.

19:31.920 --> 19:33.490
- Ok.
- Congratulations, Zhan.

19:33.490 --> 19:34.340
Congratulations.

19:34.350 --> 19:35.190
- Good job.
- Well done.

19:35.200 --> 19:36.580
Ok.

19:42.360 --> 19:43.720
Sit down, everyone.

19:46.680 --> 19:48.960
Here's a small gift,

19:48.960 --> 19:50.220
Mr. Jiang.

19:50.240 --> 19:51.260
Mr. Yu.

19:51.280 --> 19:53.340
This is carved with the ruyi motif.

19:53.360 --> 19:55.700
May you find fortune and peace.

19:55.720 --> 19:57.240
You're a member of the Guard now.

19:57.240 --> 19:59.140
Though beyond battlefield duty,

19:59.160 --> 20:01.740
let caution be your armor.

20:01.760 --> 20:04.280
So your family may breathe easy.

20:04.400 --> 20:06.660
Mr. Yu, I'm just a humble guard.

20:06.680 --> 20:07.560
Yu Qi,

20:07.560 --> 20:10.320
you are thoughtful.

20:10.760 --> 20:12.320
Thank you, Mr. Yu.

20:12.680 --> 20:14.060
Mr. Yu is right.

20:14.080 --> 20:16.000
I too have embroidered an amulet pouch

20:16.000 --> 20:17.080
as a celebration gift to you.

20:17.080 --> 20:19.020
May you enjoy safety and peace.

20:19.040 --> 20:20.680
Yi, I'm not a child anymore.

20:20.680 --> 20:22.240
It feels odd to take gifts.

20:23.600 --> 20:24.780
Zhan,

20:24.800 --> 20:25.880
I also made you

20:25.880 --> 20:26.820
a sachet.

20:26.840 --> 20:27.880
I call it

20:27.880 --> 20:29.180
"A Goose to Return".

20:29.200 --> 20:30.660
However far it is,

20:30.680 --> 20:32.780
whether it's warm or cold,

20:32.800 --> 20:34.940
a wild goose will always return.

20:34.960 --> 20:37.300
May you go to work and return

20:37.320 --> 20:39.760
safe and sound every day.

20:39.920 --> 20:41.280
Perfect!

20:41.800 --> 20:42.980
I can't pretend anymore.

20:43.000 --> 20:43.840
I love them all.

20:43.840 --> 20:45.280
Thank you, guys!

20:45.480 --> 20:46.820
Fantastic.

20:46.840 --> 20:48.880
Welcome home, Pei.

20:50.240 --> 20:51.860
Here, try this.

20:51.880 --> 20:53.420
Pei, here.

20:53.440 --> 20:55.080
Thank you, Father.

20:58.080 --> 20:59.840
Why don't you eat, Qiao?

21:00.800 --> 21:02.640
She might have a poor appetite.

21:02.720 --> 21:05.280
Qiao, try a little.

21:06.200 --> 21:08.420
Qiao, if you don't like the food,

21:08.440 --> 21:11.560
we'll try another restaurant next time.

21:12.240 --> 21:13.720
At least have a try.

21:21.680 --> 21:23.320
Why are you crying?

21:23.960 --> 21:25.560
What's wrong with her?

21:25.680 --> 21:28.340
Master, I have a favor to ask.

21:28.360 --> 21:29.540
What is it?

21:29.560 --> 21:31.460
Ma'am is arranging a marriage for Qiao

21:31.480 --> 21:33.720
with the Xiao Family, Military Commissioner.

21:34.240 --> 21:36.280
Lingbei Military Commissioner?

21:38.440 --> 21:40.160
He has got

21:40.160 --> 21:41.800
a sterling reputation

21:42.120 --> 21:45.140
with military laurels in their bloodline.

21:45.160 --> 21:47.400
If this marriage comes to pass,

21:48.920 --> 21:51.160
wouldn't that be a good match?

21:51.200 --> 21:53.000
I've made inquiries.

21:53.520 --> 21:54.600
It's their second legitimate son,

21:54.600 --> 21:55.820
Xiao Lang.

21:55.840 --> 21:57.660
He does himself with tonics and medicines.

21:57.680 --> 21:59.720
He is a sickly man.

22:02.440 --> 22:04.840
I've heard about that.

22:05.600 --> 22:08.940
The family has a son renowned for his valor.

22:08.960 --> 22:09.880
Unfortunately,

22:09.880 --> 22:12.100
he suffered a debilitating injury in battle

22:12.120 --> 22:13.400
and hasn't returned

22:13.400 --> 22:14.740
to the field since.

22:14.760 --> 22:16.680
It must be the same son

22:17.000 --> 22:19.600
we're discussing.

22:19.800 --> 22:21.160
Master,

22:22.440 --> 22:23.280
all these years,

22:23.280 --> 22:25.640
I've never asked you for anything.

22:25.800 --> 22:27.120
You brought me into this house,

22:27.120 --> 22:28.560
clothed and fed me,

22:28.560 --> 22:30.080
and gave shelter to me.

22:31.800 --> 22:33.780
But I have only two daughters.

22:33.800 --> 22:34.960
I cannot bear to see Qiao

22:34.960 --> 22:36.720
marry an invalid.

22:37.240 --> 22:39.060
That's not fair.

22:39.080 --> 22:41.940
Mr. Xiao served his country loyally

22:41.960 --> 22:43.160
and earned himself

22:43.160 --> 22:45.220
a sterling reputation.

22:45.240 --> 22:48.120
But Qiao isn't joining the army for him.

22:48.140 --> 22:49.080
What maiden

22:49.080 --> 22:51.200
would choose to marry an invalid?

22:51.420 --> 22:53.130
Raised with utmost care

22:53.140 --> 22:55.000
by Mother and yourself,

22:55.120 --> 22:57.480
how could she endure such hardships?

22:57.760 --> 22:59.300
Marrying into that family,

22:59.320 --> 23:01.640
what kind of life would she have?

23:05.160 --> 23:06.560
Master.

23:21.160 --> 23:22.760
Qiao, what do you think?

23:35.680 --> 23:37.040
Father,

23:38.400 --> 23:40.520
please don't make me go.

23:43.240 --> 23:45.000
I'm not ready to marry yet.

24:04.560 --> 24:05.920
Ok.

24:06.720 --> 24:08.320
I see.

24:21.080 --> 24:23.000
Today was truly wonderful.

24:23.640 --> 24:25.840
The moon looks even fuller.

24:27.560 --> 24:28.800
I wish this could

24:28.800 --> 24:30.100
last forever.

24:30.120 --> 24:31.640
If only I could have

24:31.640 --> 24:33.000
"A Goose to Return" sachet.

24:33.760 --> 24:34.640
Mr. Yu,

24:34.640 --> 24:36.220
we see each other every day.

24:36.240 --> 24:38.000
Where's room for "return"?

24:38.280 --> 24:40.640
I'm from Yangui, meaning "Goose to Return".

24:40.880 --> 24:41.880
Though it is

24:41.880 --> 24:43.340
a border town,

24:43.360 --> 24:45.360
chimney smoke weaves peace

24:45.380 --> 24:47.220
and the people live in contentment there.

24:47.240 --> 24:49.760
I love living in a town like that.

24:51.080 --> 24:52.340
You think so?

24:52.360 --> 24:53.720
Yes.

24:54.200 --> 24:55.620
I've often dreamed

24:55.640 --> 24:57.020
that if one day

24:57.040 --> 24:58.860
I grow weary of Ling'an,

24:58.880 --> 25:01.480
I'll retreat to a lush valley

25:01.840 --> 25:04.780
with a plot of fertile

25:04.800 --> 25:06.420
and a modest cottage

25:06.440 --> 25:07.740
to live a simple,

25:07.760 --> 25:10.480
untethered life there.

25:11.080 --> 25:12.140
When the time comes,

25:12.160 --> 25:13.960
I'll take Father,

25:14.000 --> 25:15.180
Yi,

25:15.200 --> 25:16.420
Zhan,

25:16.440 --> 25:18.080
Chuchu,

25:18.280 --> 25:19.540
Aman,

25:19.560 --> 25:20.960
and Long Dan.

25:21.490 --> 25:22.960
And,

25:24.040 --> 25:25.400
and Er'niu too.

25:27.760 --> 25:29.560
Good for you.

25:29.880 --> 25:31.760
And you.

25:33.080 --> 25:34.680
Will you come with us?

25:35.480 --> 25:37.360
Of course.

25:37.840 --> 25:39.920
Is this our agreement?

25:41.050 --> 25:41.910
Sure.

25:41.920 --> 25:43.880
Ok, I'll remember that.

25:45.120 --> 25:47.000
Will you lie to me?

25:47.160 --> 25:48.520
No way.

25:56.080 --> 25:57.800
Actually, I...

25:59.880 --> 26:01.240
You what?

26:02.120 --> 26:03.560
I wanted to tell you

26:03.560 --> 26:04.400
the moon looks fuller

26:04.400 --> 26:05.760
and more beautiful.

26:25.840 --> 26:27.780
Miss, you're in such high spirits.

26:27.800 --> 26:30.740
Because of Mr. Yu, perhaps?

26:30.760 --> 26:32.280
Not entirely.

26:33.840 --> 26:35.880
When I think of having my family

26:36.160 --> 26:37.880
gathered around

26:38.240 --> 26:40.120
and a place to call home,

26:40.880 --> 26:42.500
I realize how rare

26:42.520 --> 26:44.240
and precious this is.

26:46.240 --> 26:47.600
Aman,

26:48.280 --> 26:50.160
if only days

26:50.480 --> 26:52.140
could keep

26:52.160 --> 26:54.080
unfolding

26:54.120 --> 26:55.760
like this

26:56.480 --> 26:57.920
forever.

27:08.440 --> 27:09.880
Why meat again?

27:09.960 --> 27:11.240
Haven't I told you

27:11.240 --> 27:12.790
Ma'am follows a vegetarian diet?

27:12.920 --> 27:14.100
Never mind.

27:14.120 --> 27:15.940
Since I'm dining alone, I can't eat much.

27:15.960 --> 27:17.320
I'll skip it.

27:21.200 --> 27:22.660
Ms. Jiang Pei's returning

27:22.680 --> 27:24.800
benefits the woman at Xiaoxiang Chamber.

27:24.960 --> 27:27.100
Master Anmou specially ordered a feast

27:27.120 --> 27:29.160
to dine in her chambers.

27:30.240 --> 27:32.880
Having wormed her way in through back doors,

27:33.200 --> 27:35.800
that temptress was just lucky.

27:36.160 --> 27:38.380
What on earth does Master see in her?

27:38.400 --> 27:41.040
He never tires of her after all these years.

27:46.000 --> 27:46.980
Master.

27:47.000 --> 27:48.400
Master?

27:49.640 --> 27:51.280
Why are you here?

27:51.320 --> 27:53.520
Hurry, fetch a pot of wine.

27:54.480 --> 27:56.060
You haven't dined yet, right?

27:56.080 --> 27:57.640
Perfect, come.

27:57.720 --> 27:59.280
Let's dine together.

27:59.480 --> 28:02.080
I need to have a word with you.

28:03.200 --> 28:04.760
How can takeout

28:04.760 --> 28:06.920
compare to home-cooked meals?

28:07.320 --> 28:08.580
Here.

28:08.600 --> 28:10.640
I'll drink with you.

28:19.560 --> 28:20.920
I'll help myself.

28:31.360 --> 28:32.720
Darling,

28:33.880 --> 28:35.600
don't worry

28:36.200 --> 28:37.800
about Qiao's marriage.

28:38.800 --> 28:39.860
Just let them

28:39.880 --> 28:42.480
handle it themselves.

28:46.000 --> 28:47.940
I was wondering

28:47.960 --> 28:49.840
what gust of wind carried you here.

28:50.280 --> 28:51.520
Turns out it was Concubine Ruan's

28:51.520 --> 28:52.940
whispering.

28:52.960 --> 28:54.680
The reason doesn't matter.

28:58.880 --> 29:00.240
Either way,

29:00.360 --> 29:02.360
this is none of your concern now.

29:02.440 --> 29:05.360
But I will meddle regardless.

29:07.640 --> 29:11.860
What, does my word not matter?

29:11.880 --> 29:12.920
As your

29:12.920 --> 29:15.620
properly married wife

29:15.640 --> 29:17.120
and the mistress

29:17.120 --> 29:18.740
of the Earl Dongping's household,

29:18.760 --> 29:20.560
arranging our children's marriage

29:20.840 --> 29:23.040
is my rightful charge.

29:24.840 --> 29:27.260
While your word is law,

29:27.280 --> 29:30.620
we must uphold tradition.

29:30.640 --> 29:32.560
Surely we can't disgrace our family

29:32.560 --> 29:35.560
over a concubine-born daughter.

29:37.880 --> 29:40.240
What's all the fuss about?

29:41.040 --> 29:43.520
Has Ling'an run out of gossip?

29:43.920 --> 29:46.340
Must everyone fixate on my daughter?

29:46.360 --> 29:47.540
Besides,

29:47.560 --> 29:48.400
Pei's marriage

29:48.400 --> 29:50.080
was arranged by her mother.

29:50.240 --> 29:51.080
Look how well

29:51.090 --> 29:53.160
she's doing now.

29:53.840 --> 29:55.200
The fault lies

29:55.920 --> 29:57.820
in your poor choice anyway.

29:57.840 --> 30:00.240
As for Pei, I intended to betroth her

30:00.240 --> 30:02.940
to Mr. Zhen Heng of the Capital Security.

30:02.960 --> 30:05.160
They rushed

30:05.160 --> 30:06.080
her marriage

30:06.080 --> 30:07.840
while I was indisposed.

30:09.520 --> 30:10.920
Master,

30:11.440 --> 30:13.340
don't always

30:13.360 --> 30:15.760
believe one-sided whispers.

30:15.780 --> 30:17.920
Qiao ranks third

30:17.920 --> 30:19.780
among our household's daughters.

30:19.800 --> 30:21.700
Her youth is fading.

30:21.720 --> 30:22.880
The child

30:22.880 --> 30:25.120
is shy, reserved, and silent,

30:25.120 --> 30:26.080
like a tomb

30:26.080 --> 30:28.140
when taken out in public.

30:28.160 --> 30:29.280
Arranging her marriage

30:29.280 --> 30:32.000
is doubly challenging.

30:32.320 --> 30:33.340
Moreover,

30:33.360 --> 30:34.840
our household

30:34.840 --> 30:37.040
isn't what it once was.

30:37.160 --> 30:39.780
Jiang Si's engagement revocation

30:39.800 --> 30:41.000
caused a scandal

30:41.000 --> 30:43.080
in Ling'an.

30:43.080 --> 30:45.260
Haven't we been mocked enough?

30:45.280 --> 30:47.600
Must your daughter

30:47.600 --> 30:49.880
follow suit?

30:52.480 --> 30:53.840
Darling,

30:54.600 --> 30:56.180
you're a mother yourself.

30:56.200 --> 30:57.600
However Mr. Xiao shines in other aspects,

30:57.600 --> 30:59.600
look into your heart and tell me,

30:59.800 --> 31:00.840
do you truly believe

31:00.840 --> 31:02.860
he is a good match for your daughter?

31:02.880 --> 31:05.300
Mr. Xiao may be frail,

31:05.320 --> 31:07.080
but his weak health

31:07.080 --> 31:08.460
stems from battlefield valor.

31:08.480 --> 31:10.240
He made military contributions

31:10.240 --> 31:11.880
for His Majesty.

31:11.880 --> 31:14.360
Countless men have made contributions

31:14.880 --> 31:16.040
and His Majesty

31:16.040 --> 31:17.400
favors many.

31:17.560 --> 31:20.040
But you can't pick an invalid!

31:20.080 --> 31:21.260
I know

31:21.280 --> 31:23.780
you've held a grudge against Ruan,

31:23.800 --> 31:25.400
but you can't

31:25.400 --> 31:27.640
take it out on her daughter.

31:29.160 --> 31:30.520
Master,

31:30.840 --> 31:32.560
what grudge could I possibly

31:32.560 --> 31:34.680
hold against her?

31:34.760 --> 31:35.800
How could I take it out

31:35.800 --> 31:37.960
on her daughter?

31:41.040 --> 31:42.180
Master,

31:42.200 --> 31:44.440
I'm doing this for your sake

31:44.600 --> 31:46.740
and to uphold our dignity.

31:46.760 --> 31:48.500
Zhan joined the Guard.

31:48.520 --> 31:50.420
When we left Mother's chambers,

31:50.440 --> 31:52.480
others might not know what was on your mind,

31:52.480 --> 31:53.920
but do you think I didn't see your heart?

31:53.920 --> 31:55.080
Say no more!

31:55.080 --> 31:56.460
I've never seen

31:56.480 --> 31:58.000
a mistress of any household

31:58.000 --> 31:59.180
sowing discord

31:59.200 --> 32:01.680
and twisting the truth like you.

32:02.520 --> 32:03.880
Even at my worst,

32:04.080 --> 32:06.700
I'd never scheme against my own daughter.

32:06.720 --> 32:07.780
Darling,

32:07.800 --> 32:08.800
not everyone is a pawn

32:08.800 --> 32:10.400
to be exploited.

32:10.560 --> 32:11.860
Did you

32:11.880 --> 32:14.040
drive Qian away in the same way?

32:17.640 --> 32:19.160
Unfortunately,

32:20.320 --> 32:22.720
you arrived a step too late today.

32:23.680 --> 32:24.540
What do you mean?

32:24.560 --> 32:26.020
I have already agreed

32:26.040 --> 32:27.460
to the Xiao Family's proposal.

32:27.480 --> 32:29.180
The letter has been dispatched,

32:29.200 --> 32:30.080
bearing the official seal

32:30.080 --> 32:32.260
of Earl Dongping's Mansion.

32:32.280 --> 32:33.640
You!

32:33.680 --> 32:35.580
How do you act on your own authority?

32:35.600 --> 32:37.920
Mother is aware of this.

32:38.800 --> 32:41.380
Also, arranging our children's marriage is,

32:41.400 --> 32:42.820
by custom and right,

32:42.840 --> 32:44.680
my rightful charge

32:44.680 --> 32:46.200
as their lineal mother.

32:46.680 --> 32:48.200
Unreasonable!

32:49.080 --> 32:51.000
If you truly object,

32:51.000 --> 32:52.380
it doesn't matter.

32:52.400 --> 32:54.020
Isn't it just a letter?

32:54.040 --> 32:55.580
You can follow Ancheng's example

32:55.600 --> 32:58.940
and go to the Xiao Mansion to destroy it.

32:58.960 --> 33:00.320
You!

33:02.840 --> 33:04.200
Master.

33:10.520 --> 33:15.560
(Exquisite dice inlaid with red beans)

33:23.600 --> 33:26.560
Exquisite dice inlaid with red beans,

33:26.600 --> 33:30.360
do you know my bone-deep longing?

33:31.160 --> 33:32.680
Miss, this is good.

33:34.600 --> 33:35.860
No, no.

33:35.880 --> 33:37.320
It's not reserved enough.

33:38.600 --> 33:40.350
It's just a message of love.

33:40.370 --> 33:41.860
What's so complicated about it?

33:41.880 --> 33:43.580
You don't understand.

33:43.600 --> 33:45.280
I'll try a few more.

34:07.760 --> 34:12.200
(You give me a peach, and I return jade.)

34:13.720 --> 34:16.100
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

34:16.100 --> 34:20.330
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

34:21.040 --> 34:23.440
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

34:23.460 --> 34:27.120
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

34:27.140 --> 34:30.560
♪ Growing between us ♪

34:30.720 --> 34:32.040
(Chen hour, Jiuqu Pavilion, see the moon.)

34:32.040 --> 34:33.440
That's it.

35:15.280 --> 35:22.800
(Tianxiang House)

35:26.720 --> 35:29.880
(Tianxiang House)

35:31.160 --> 35:34.840
Chen hour, Jiuqu Pavilion, see the moon.

35:37.120 --> 35:38.540
Seems Jiang Si

35:38.560 --> 35:40.920
has a secret crush on Mr. Yu.

35:41.320 --> 35:43.720
I care little for romantic matters.

35:44.000 --> 35:45.020
Stick to business.

35:45.040 --> 35:47.360
Don't be a spoilsport.

35:47.400 --> 35:48.820
Besides,

35:48.840 --> 35:50.840
this is the business at hand.

35:54.520 --> 35:55.880
What do you mean?

35:57.960 --> 36:00.160
Jiang Si once posed

36:00.160 --> 36:02.340
as Envoy Zhao Yu of the North Affiliate.

36:02.360 --> 36:03.780
With the Nightingale Token,

36:03.800 --> 36:06.080
she came to me to inquire about the Saintess.

36:11.360 --> 36:12.720
What's the problem?

36:14.200 --> 36:16.120
Later, I investigated her.

36:16.400 --> 36:17.780
Born in Ling'an,

36:17.800 --> 36:19.760
she's never left Dazhou.

36:19.920 --> 36:21.540
How does a lady secluded in her chambers

36:21.560 --> 36:23.560
know about the Saintess?

36:23.880 --> 36:24.980
Moreover,

36:25.000 --> 36:27.480
how does she know my perfume formulas?

36:30.040 --> 36:31.600
Interesting.

36:31.720 --> 36:33.320
If she is the Saintess,

36:34.800 --> 36:38.000
her affection for Mr. Yu has brewed treason,

36:38.170 --> 36:40.160
then she should be arrested and disciplined.

36:40.680 --> 36:42.240
If not,

36:42.960 --> 36:44.560
I would like to see

36:44.800 --> 36:46.800
who she really is.

37:30.120 --> 37:31.940
Miss, how about this dress?

37:31.960 --> 37:33.120
The vibrant colors

37:33.120 --> 37:35.200
accentuate your delicate charm.

37:37.520 --> 37:39.520
Perhaps too many floral patterns.

37:40.440 --> 37:41.460
Let's keep looking.

37:41.480 --> 37:42.840
Yes.

37:50.120 --> 37:52.140
Miss, this one is perfect! Perfect!

37:52.160 --> 37:53.660
Such elegance

37:53.680 --> 37:55.800
fits for a noble lady.

37:56.560 --> 37:59.160
Aren't the embroideries too elaborate?

37:59.960 --> 38:01.200
But many noble ladies

38:01.200 --> 38:03.100
in Ling'an adore this style.

38:03.120 --> 38:04.440
It appeals to young lords.

38:04.440 --> 38:05.840
Really?

38:08.040 --> 38:09.520
Let's look again.

38:14.960 --> 38:16.420
How's it going? Ready yet?

38:16.440 --> 38:17.800
Almost done.

38:18.680 --> 38:20.520
Ok, you can turn around now.

38:24.280 --> 38:26.280
So, how do I look in this?

38:26.520 --> 38:27.920
Gorgeous!

38:27.960 --> 38:29.920
What about that one?

38:29.960 --> 38:31.020
Also looks great.

38:31.040 --> 38:32.380
Both look great?

38:32.400 --> 38:34.320
It's all because of your stunning looks.

38:34.960 --> 38:36.740
No way, you have to pick one.

38:36.760 --> 38:37.800
Don't put me on the spot, please.

38:37.800 --> 38:39.480
I spend all day with those guys.

38:39.480 --> 38:40.640
I don't know the first thing

38:40.640 --> 38:42.140
about women's fashion.

38:42.160 --> 38:43.080
No way.

38:43.080 --> 38:44.540
You have to pick one.

38:44.560 --> 38:46.120
Which one is actually better?

38:48.000 --> 38:49.120
Here's what I think.

38:49.120 --> 38:50.960
Does it feel comfortable on you?

38:50.960 --> 38:51.960
If it does, it is great.

38:51.960 --> 38:53.300
It has nothing to do with others' eyes.

38:53.320 --> 38:55.240
But you're no mere "others".

38:57.080 --> 38:58.300
Then answer me this.

38:58.320 --> 39:00.820
If I changed my clothes today,

39:00.840 --> 39:01.680
would that alter

39:01.680 --> 39:02.660
your feelings for me?

39:02.680 --> 39:03.520
Absolutely not.

39:03.520 --> 39:05.280
Neither would I.

39:22.800 --> 39:24.360
(Chen hour, Jiuqu Pavilion)
I found this

39:24.360 --> 39:25.940
(See the moon)
in Liu Yan'er's room.

39:26.160 --> 39:27.960
It's her help from Nanwu.

39:28.400 --> 39:30.720
They're going to make a big move tonight.

39:31.280 --> 39:32.920
This handwriting

39:33.640 --> 39:34.900
looks like Jiang Si's.

39:34.920 --> 39:36.560
Is she really Nanwu's Saintess?

39:38.040 --> 39:40.240
There must be some misunderstanding.

39:44.120 --> 39:45.480
Chief,

39:46.640 --> 39:49.100
if Jiang Si truly is the Saintess,

39:49.120 --> 39:49.920
the one who has been

39:49.920 --> 39:51.840
manipulating the Nightingale Division

39:52.000 --> 39:54.400
and deceiving you from the beginning,

40:02.400 --> 40:03.520
can you kill her

40:03.520 --> 40:04.880
without hesitation?

40:16.520 --> 40:18.320
The flames are really blazing.

40:19.280 --> 40:20.640
Mother.

40:20.800 --> 40:22.160
Mother.

40:23.320 --> 40:24.480
At this late hour,

40:24.480 --> 40:26.420
what brings you here?

40:26.440 --> 40:27.520
My family

40:27.520 --> 40:30.420
sent me a silk quilt.

40:30.440 --> 40:31.540
Its fabric

40:31.560 --> 40:34.700
is delicate and smooth.

40:34.720 --> 40:37.260
It feels comfortable against the skin.

40:37.280 --> 40:39.620
Best of all, it's scented

40:39.640 --> 40:41.660
with soothing herbs to help you sleep.

40:41.680 --> 40:43.680
So I brought it over for you.

40:44.280 --> 40:46.460
Such a fine gift!

40:46.480 --> 40:48.320
I'll gladly accept it.

40:48.640 --> 40:50.580
I appreciate this kindness.

40:50.600 --> 40:51.620
Mother.

40:51.640 --> 40:54.020
Take it inside and spread it for Mother.

40:54.040 --> 40:55.300
Fu, go help.

40:55.320 --> 40:57.000
No need. Let her take care of it.

40:57.000 --> 40:58.680
You just brew the tea.

40:58.960 --> 41:00.480
Well, Mother.

41:47.960 --> 41:49.900
Did anyone see you at Mother's chambers?

41:49.920 --> 41:50.820
No.

41:50.840 --> 41:52.480
I was very careful.

41:52.800 --> 41:56.060
But using the seal can't be hidden forever.

41:56.080 --> 41:57.920
What shall we do if the Elder Lady

41:57.920 --> 41:59.440
inquires later?

41:59.520 --> 42:00.660
Relax.

42:00.680 --> 42:02.260
I mentioned the marriage

42:02.280 --> 42:03.780
to her,

42:03.800 --> 42:05.280
and she didn't object.

42:05.760 --> 42:07.640
Didn't we request

42:08.040 --> 42:09.700
to use the family seal a few days ago?

42:09.720 --> 42:10.880
Let's say

42:10.880 --> 42:12.240
it was stamped then.

42:13.040 --> 42:14.920
Even if she finds out,

42:14.920 --> 42:16.780
it's not a serious offense.

42:16.800 --> 42:18.340
Ma'am, why exert so much effort

42:18.360 --> 42:21.000
for Ruan's daughter?

42:23.520 --> 42:25.720
The more she resists,

42:25.720 --> 42:28.640
the more I'll cement this marriage.

42:29.160 --> 42:31.660
How dare she whine to Master?

42:31.680 --> 42:33.880
Since she spurns my goodwill regardless,

42:34.160 --> 42:36.700
I'll claim my due dignity

42:36.720 --> 42:39.000
by crushing her defiance.

42:40.400 --> 42:41.520
Tomorrow morning,

42:41.520 --> 42:44.440
deliver this letter to the Xiao Mansion.

42:45.880 --> 42:47.240
Yes.

42:49.840 --> 42:54.240
(The End of Episode 20)

42:54.650 --> 42:56.380
♪ From place to place ♪

42:56.380 --> 43:01.320
♪ I drift in the world alone ♪

43:01.690 --> 43:04.070
♪ The cool breeze comes and goes ♪

43:04.070 --> 43:08.300
♪ I dare to love and hate ♪

43:09.010 --> 43:11.410
♪ Ask the day and the night ♪

43:11.430 --> 43:15.090
♪ If they saw a glimmer fall and take root ♪

43:15.110 --> 43:18.530
♪ Growing between us ♪

43:18.680 --> 43:24.200
♪ And breeding love ♪

43:25.020 --> 43:28.700
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

43:28.700 --> 43:32.780
♪ In the end, we're still together ♪

43:33.020 --> 43:34.760
♪ Like shadows ♪

43:34.780 --> 43:39.480
♪ We're brave enough to advance together ♪

43:39.480 --> 43:43.050
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

43:43.070 --> 43:47.300
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

43:47.320 --> 43:49.100
♪ Time glows ♪

43:49.100 --> 43:53.640
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

43:53.660 --> 43:58.460
♪ And stars ♪

44:02.690 --> 44:05.220
♪ Don't ask what our fate is ♪

44:05.240 --> 44:08.860
♪ Let life carve the growth rings ♪

44:08.880 --> 44:12.310
♪ We'll reach the end eventually ♪

44:12.330 --> 44:16.950
♪ All will bloom in spring ♪

44:16.950 --> 44:20.640
♪ We promise each other the future ♪

44:20.660 --> 44:24.750
♪ Our bond trickles down from youth ♪

44:24.860 --> 44:26.680
♪ Time glows ♪

44:26.680 --> 44:31.230
♪ Together, we'll see light ♪

44:31.250 --> 44:34.950
♪ Smile at each other for the future ♪

44:34.970 --> 44:39.130
♪ We travel at night in the cold ♪

44:39.310 --> 44:41.070
♪ The moonlight shines like water ♪

44:41.070 --> 44:45.590
♪ Those in love will have sweet dreams ♪

44:45.590 --> 44:49.230
♪ Cherish each other in the future ♪

44:49.250 --> 44:54.920
♪ Time goes by, but memories remain ♪

44:56.610 --> 44:58.540
♪ Take a look to remember everything ♪

44:58.540 --> 45:06.040
♪ We will see flowers fill the city again ♪
